---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { disclaimers, firm, offer, barLookupUrl, firmPolicyLinks } from '@/config/site';
import { url } from '@/lib/url';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Legal Disclaimer"
  description="Legal disclaimer, attorney advertising notice and jurisdiction information for the Hoffman Legal demand letter service."
>
  {/* Draft for attorney review before launch. */}
  <h2>Attorney advertising</h2>
  <p>{disclaimers.attorneyAdvertising} {disclaimers.advertising}</p>

  <h2>No legal advice</h2>
  <p>
    The information on this website is general information only. It is not legal advice and should not be relied on as
    a substitute for advice about your specific situation.
  </p>

  <h2>No attorney-client relationship</h2>
  <p>
    Visiting this website, submitting an inquiry, or calling or emailing {firm.name} does not create an attorney-client
    relationship. An attorney-client relationship is formed only if {firm.name} accepts your matter, completes a conflict
    check and you sign a written engagement agreement. Until then, please do not send confidential or highly sensitive
    information.
  </p>

  <h2>Scope of representation</h2>
  <p>
    The {offer.priceDisplay} service covers one attorney-prepared demand letter. It does not automatically include
    litigation, court proceedings, settlement negotiations, additional letters or extensive investigation. If your matter
    is accepted, the scope of the representation is governed by the engagement agreement you sign.
  </p>

  <h2>No guarantee of results</h2>
  <p>
    {disclaimers.results} A demand letter does not guarantee that the other party will pay, respond or resolve the
    dispute, and it does not prevent anyone from filing a lawsuit.
  </p>

  <h2>Legal deadlines</h2>
  <p>
    Sending a demand letter does not stop, pause or extend a statute of limitations or any other legal deadline. Some
    claims also have specific notice requirements, and this service does not guarantee that any such requirement is
    satisfied. If you believe a deadline may apply to your matter, seek legal advice promptly.
  </p>

  <h2>Jurisdiction</h2>
  <p>
    {firm.legalName} is a Florida law firm located at {firm.address.street}, {firm.address.city},
    {firm.address.region} {firm.address.postalCode}. This service is focused on disputes connected to Florida and is not
    available for every matter or in every jurisdiction. Information on this website relates to Florida unless otherwise
    stated. The license status of any Florida attorney can be checked through
    <a href={barLookupUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Florida Bar’s member search</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Related policies</h2>
  <p>
    See this website’s <a href={url('/privacy/')}>Privacy Policy</a> and <a href={url('/terms/')}>Terms of Use</a>.
    {
      firmPolicyLinks.privacy || firmPolicyLinks.terms ? (
        <>
          {firm.name}’s firm-wide policies are available on the firm website:
          {firmPolicyLinks.privacy && <a href={firmPolicyLinks.privacy}>Privacy Policy</a>}
          {firmPolicyLinks.privacy && firmPolicyLinks.terms && ' and '}
          {firmPolicyLinks.terms && <a href={firmPolicyLinks.terms}>Terms</a>}.
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          More information about the firm is available at <a href={firm.website}>hoffman.legal</a>.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
